{"seq":2,"slug":"kms-integration-envelope-key-management","title":"KMS 集成、信封加密与外部密钥管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/secrets-management-vault-dynamic-secrets-encryption/rotation-kms-ha-ops/kms-integration-envelope-key-management","wordCount":2598,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"kms-集成-信封加密与外部密钥管理\">KMS 集成、信封加密与外部密钥管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨境电商系统的密钥有两类用途，混在一起谈就会做出错误的架构。<strong>一类保护 Vault 自己</strong>（unseal key、root key、keyring），<strong>另一类保护业务数据</strong>（订单 PII、支付令牌、买家手机号）。前者关心&quot;重启后能否自动解开&quot;，后者关心&quot;海量字段如何在不把长期密钥放进应用内存的前提下加密&quot;——KMS 集成的全部设计空间就落在这个交集上。三个概念先钉死：<strong>KEK</strong> 长期存在、权限极高、轮换代价大，云 KMS 里的 CMK 就是 KEK；<strong>DEK</strong> 一把一用、随数据走的短命密钥；<strong>信封加密</strong>用 DEK 加密数据、用 KEK 加密 DEK，把&quot;被包裹的 DEK&quot;随密文一起存储。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;业务明文&lt;br/&gt;买家 PII / 支付记录&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;DEK&lt;br/&gt;每次加密新生成&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;密文数据&lt;br/&gt;落业务库&quot;]&#10;    D[&quot;KEK&lt;br/&gt;云 KMS CMK / HSM 主密钥&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;Wrap(DEK)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;wrapped DEK&lt;br/&gt;随密文存储&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;解密方&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;Unwrap(DEK)&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"业务明文&lt;br/&gt;买家 PII / 支付记录\"] --&gt; B[\"DEK&lt;br/&gt;每次加密新生成\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"密文数据&lt;br/&gt;落业务库\"]\n    D[\"KEK&lt;br/&gt;云 KMS CMK / HSM 主密钥\"] --&gt; E[\"Wrap(DEK)\"]\n    B --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[\"wrapped DEK&lt;br/&gt;随密文存储\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"解密方\"]\n    F --&gt; G\n    D --&gt; H[\"Unwrap(DEK)\"]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; A</pre><p>这张图解释了信封加密为何能同时满足&quot;性能&quot;与&quot;密钥不出域&quot;：<strong>KEK 从不离开 KMS，且每个数据对象只调用一次 KMS</strong>。AWS 官方描述为&quot;KMS 生成 256-bit data key，服务用明文 data key 加密对象、随即销毁明文，只把加密后的 data key 与对象一起存储&quot;（<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/developerguide/data-keys.html\">AWS KMS data keys</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信封加密的数据流与密钥层次\">信封加密的数据流与密钥层次</h2><p>一次真实调用可写成三层数学式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub><mo>←</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>256</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>dek</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>kek</mtext></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{\\text{data}} \\leftarrow \\mathrm{Rand}(256),\\quad C_{\\text{data}} = \\mathrm{AEAD}_{K_{\\text{data}}}(M),\\quad C_{\\text{dek}} = \\mathrm{AEAD}_{K_{\\text{kek}}}(K_{\\text{data}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Rand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">256</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0059em;vertical-align:-0.2559em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">AEAD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2559em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dek</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0059em;vertical-align:-0.2559em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">AEAD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">kek</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2559em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>存储的是二元组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>dek</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(C_{\\text{data}}, C_{\\text{dek}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dek</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，明文 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{\\text{data}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 都不落盘。Vault 的 Transit 把它拆成两个接口：<code>transit/datakey/plaintext/&lt;key&gt;</code> 返回 <code>plaintext</code>（明文 DEK，只在内存用一次）与 <code>ciphertext</code>（被 KEK 包裹的 DEK）；<code>transit/decrypt/&lt;key&gt;</code> 接受被包裹的 DEK 返回明文。官方指出明文返回&quot;可以关闭以适配审计要求&quot;，高合规环境改用 <code>transit/datakey/wrapped/&lt;key&gt;</code>，明文从不出 Vault（<a href=\"https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs/secrets/transit\">Vault Transit</a>）。这也是它的成本逻辑：KMS 调用从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>记录数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\text{记录数})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">记录数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>对象数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\text{对象数})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">对象数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>AWS 在 external key store（XKS）场景再加一层：数据先被 AWS KMS 自己的 key material 加密一次，再被你的外部管理器加密一次，称为 <strong>double encryption</strong>，任何一方都无法单独解密（<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/developerguide/keystore-external.html\">AWS KMS XKS</a>）。这既是深度防御，也是&quot;crypto-shred&quot;手段：撤销外部密钥访问，AWS 侧残留密文立即不可恢复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"vault-与云-kms-的三种集成形态\">Vault 与云 KMS 的三种集成形态</h2><p>把 KMS 接进 Vault 不是一种做法，而是三种职责完全不同的做法。选错层，就会在错误的位置承担可用性风险。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>保护对象</th>\n<th>是否 Enterprise 专属</th>\n<th>KMS 何时被调用</th>\n<th>典型风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Auto-unseal</strong></td>\n<td>root key（解封）</td>\n<td>否，所有版本支持</td>\n<td>仅在节点启动/解封时</td>\n<td>KMS 不可用 → 重启后无法解开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Seal Wrap</strong></td>\n<td>keyring、root key、transit 密钥等 CSP</td>\n<td>是（Plus/HSM 许可）</td>\n<td>运行时持续调用</td>\n<td>KMS/HSM 抖动直接拖慢 Vault</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Managed Keys</strong></td>\n<td>交给外部 KMS 的私钥操作</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>每次密码学操作</td>\n<td>外部系统成为数据面依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Auto-unseal</strong> 的配置面很小，语义却最重。AWS 接法是一段 <code>seal &quot;awskms&quot;</code> 块，只需 <code>region</code>、<code>kms_key_id</code>（可用 <code>alias/</code> 别名）与可选的 VPC <code>endpoint</code>；节点所需 IAM 权限只有 <code>kms:Encrypt</code>、<code>kms:Decrypt</code>、<code>kms:DescribeKey</code>。官方强调：授权必须严格绑定 Vault 节点身份（instance role / web identity），<strong>拥有 <code>kms:Decrypt</code> 的身份等价于拥有解封 Vault 的能力</strong>；静态 access key 不应写进配置文件；用 VPC endpoint 让调用不走公网。还要留意：KMS 支持自动与手动轮换，但&quot;旧 key 不能被 disable 或 delete&quot;，历史密文仍要靠它解开（<a href=\"https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs/configuration/seal/awskms\">Vault AWS KMS seal</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>Seal Wrap</strong> 是 Enterprise 能力，在支持的 seal 上<strong>默认开启</strong>。它把 Vault 内部的 Critical Security Parameter 在 Barrier 之外再套一层 KMS/HSM 加密，覆盖 root key、keyring 及 PKI issuers、SSH CA key、Transit 密钥等（<a href=\"https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs/enterprise/sealwrap\">Vault Seal Wrap</a>）。两个工程后果：<strong>KMS 从&quot;启动依赖&quot;升级为&quot;运行时依赖&quot;</strong>——开启后 KMS 必须在 Vault 运行时持续可用，非 HA 部署里 HSM 断连会直接损害 Vault；以及<strong>性能代价真实存在</strong>——远程 seal 的读写可能&quot;慢一到两个数量级&quot;，未包裹的值靠内存缓存缓解，故各插件通常只包裹极少量核心值。</p>\n<p><strong>Managed Keys</strong> 把密钥操作本身外移：<code>sys/managed-key</code> 支持 <code>PKCS#11</code>、<code>AWS KMS</code>、<code>Azure Key Vault</code>、<code>Google Cloud KMS</code> 四类后端，一个命名 managed key 对应后端里的一把具体密钥；Transit 用它签名/验签，PKI 用它签发证书，私钥操作全部发生在外部 KMS/HSM 上（<a href=\"https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs/enterprise/managed-keys\">Vault Managed Keys</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"轮换周期-密钥版本与-kms-调用成本\">轮换周期、密钥版本与 KMS 调用成本</h2><p>轮换周期不是运维偏好，它有密码学下界。NIST SP 800-38D 对 GCM 的建议是：<strong>同一密钥版本累计加密次数接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{32}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次前必须轮换</strong>，因为 GCM 的安全性随同一 nonce 空间下的加密量下降（<a href=\"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/38/d/final\">NIST SP 800-38D</a>）。把下界换算成周期就是一道除法：若某 Transit key 每天处理 4000 万次加密，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>107</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{32} / 4\\times10^{7} \\approx 107</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">107</span></span></span></span></span> 天，&quot;每季度轮换&quot;是被数据推出来的结论。轮换分三种粒度，选错会导致迁移事故：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>是否重写历史密文</th>\n<th>是否需授权人参与</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>transit/keys/&lt;k&gt;/rotate</code></td>\n<td>Transit key 新增版本</td>\n<td>否，旧版本保留解密</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>transit/rewrap/&lt;k&gt;</code></td>\n<td>把旧版密文换到最新版</td>\n<td>逐条重写密文，明文不出 Vault</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>operator rotate</code> / <code>operator rekey</code></td>\n<td>barrier key / root key</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>rekey 需 threshold 份份额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>rewrap</code> 最值得强调：它&quot;不暴露明文数据&quot;，因此可以把 rewrap 权限单独授给一个不受信任的批处理进程，让它慢速滚动几十亿条历史密文，而不给它任何解密能力。相反的做法——&quot;解密再加密&quot;——会让明文出现在过程中，应极力避免。还有一个容量陷阱：Transit 的归档版本是单个存储条目，在 Raft/Paxos 后端上频繁轮换会撞上条目大小上限，官方的缓解是改用<strong>时间分桶的命名 key</strong>。成本侧同理：每对象一次调用比每字段一次调用能压下一个量级的 KMS 调用量，而每租户一把 key 会把月费乘以租户数——电商常见折中是&quot;按区域 × 数据分级&quot;分 key。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境数据驻留与多区域密钥拓扑\">跨境数据驻留与多区域密钥拓扑</h2><p>对跨境电商而言，密钥托管地点本身就是合规变量，而不是单纯的技术选址。面向中国境内用户的个人信息，若用境外 KMS 托管 KEK，可能触及个人信息出境的评估/认证要求（PIPL 第 38 条对向境外提供个人信息设定了安全评估、认证或标准合同路径），因此&quot;密钥驻留地 = 数据驻留地&quot;通常被显式写进架构决策。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    C[&quot;全局控制面&lt;br/&gt;策略/审计/密钥元数据&quot;] -.-&gt; A1&#10;    C -.-&gt; B1&#10;    subgraph CN[&quot;中国区&quot;]&#10;        A1[&quot;本地 KMS CMK&quot;] --&gt; A2[&quot;Transit key cn-pii&quot;] --&gt; A3[&quot;买家 PII 密文&lt;br/&gt;存储于区域内&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph SG[&quot;东南亚区&quot;]&#10;        B1[&quot;区域 KMS CMK&quot;] --&gt; B2[&quot;Transit key sg-pii&quot;] --&gt; B3[&quot;订单密文&lt;br/&gt;存储于区域内&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    C[\"全局控制面&lt;br/&gt;策略/审计/密钥元数据\"] -.-&gt; A1\n    C -.-&gt; B1\n    subgraph CN[\"中国区\"]\n        A1[\"本地 KMS CMK\"] --&gt; A2[\"Transit key cn-pii\"] --&gt; A3[\"买家 PII 密文&lt;br/&gt;存储于区域内\"]\n    end\n    subgraph SG[\"东南亚区\"]\n        B1[\"区域 KMS CMK\"] --&gt; B2[\"Transit key sg-pii\"] --&gt; B3[\"订单密文&lt;br/&gt;存储于区域内\"]\n    end</pre><p>关键约束是：<strong>控制面可以全局，密钥面必须区域化。</strong> 全局 Vault 控制面负责策略、审计、密钥元数据；真正的 KEK 由各区域 KMS 托管，跨区不共享、不复制密钥材料。这与 Vault 在 Seal Wrap 上的一条设计一致：复制（replication）&quot;对 seal wrapping 透明&quot;，每个本地集群用自己的 seal 完成包裹，<strong>下游集群不需要共享 HSM/KMS 密钥</strong>。若合规要求密钥完全不可被云厂商触及（HYOK 场景），才进入 external key store 领域，其代价是：AWS 官方评估&quot;对大多数客户而言，可用性与延迟的增加风险将超过外部密钥存储带来的安全收益&quot;；XKS <strong>不支持自动轮换、非对称与 HMAC key、多区域 key</strong>，每账号每区域最多 10 个 custom key store，建议与区域网络 RTT 在 <strong>35 毫秒以内</strong>，且明确不支持中国（北京/宁夏）区域——这直接把&quot;中国区数据 + XKS&quot;排除在外。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高可用-当-kms-成为新的单点\">高可用：当 KMS 成为新的单点</h2><p>引入 KMS 的那一刻，系统就多了一个硬依赖。可运维的做法是把&quot;KMS 抖动&quot;当成一类已建模的故障来设计。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>控制面故障（auto-unseal 路径）</strong>：KMS 不可用只影响重启与解封，已运行的 active 节点继续服务，风险窗口被限制在&quot;重启恰逢 KMS 抖动&quot;。缓解：KMS 调用走 VPC endpoint，key 与 Vault 同区域。</li>\n<li><strong>数据面故障（seal wrap 路径）</strong>：KMS/HSM 抖动会经 seal wrap 传导到运行中的 Vault（官方已警告非 HA 下 HSM 断连会损害 Vault）。缓解是 <strong>HA 拓扑 + 内存缓存 + 关闭非必要的 backend seal_wrap</strong>：<code>disable_sealwrap=true</code> 只停止对普通存储条目的包裹，<strong>不影响 auto-unseal 功能</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>DEK 缓存滞后</strong>：AWS 服务会短暂缓存 data key，KMS key 不可用后已缓存的 data key 仍能工作到缓存过期，这既是缓冲窗口，也意味着<strong>撤销密钥访问并非瞬时生效</strong>，吊销演练必须把滞后算进去。</li>\n<li><strong>权限漂移</strong>：auto-unseal 的信任根是 IAM 与 KMS key policy，能改这两处的身份等价于能解封 Vault，审计重点应在 <code>kms:Decrypt</code> 授权面而非 Vault 自身配置。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>合规时间的收口也在这里：CMVP 已停止接受新的 FIPS 140-2 提交，全部 FIPS 140-2 证书在 <strong>2026 年 9 月 21 日</strong> 被移入历史列表；Seal Wrap 的合规声明随之锚定 FIPS 140-3，安全等级跟随所配 HSM（Level 3 HSM 即对应 140-3 Level 3）。<strong>2026 年下半年之后新建的方案，应在选型阶段就直接问&quot;FIPS 140-3 验证模块证书编号是多少&quot;</strong>（<a href=\"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/140-3/final\">FIPS 140-3</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>KEK 长期、DEK 一用一弃、信封加密把 KMS 调用从每字段降到每对象</strong>，高吞吐电商写入路径上这是唯一可行的接法。</li>\n<li><strong>KMS 接进 Vault 有三种职责不同的形态</strong>：auto-unseal 只保护解封（所有版本可用），Seal Wrap 把它升级为运行时依赖（Enterprise 且默认开启，远程调用可能慢一到两个数量级），Managed Keys 把密钥操作本身外移。</li>\n<li><strong>轮换周期由数据推算</strong>：NIST SP 800-38D 要求同一版本加密量接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{32}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次前轮换；用 <code>rotate</code> 加版本、用 <code>rewrap</code> 原地滚动密文（明文不出 Vault），切忌&quot;解密再加密&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>跨区域拓扑的硬约束是&quot;控制面可全局、密钥面必区域化&quot;</strong>；XKS 的 sovereignty 收益伴随可用性/延迟代价，且不支持自动轮换与中国区域。</li>\n<li><strong>KMS 是新的单点</strong>：控制面故障只影响解封，数据面故障（seal wrap）会拖慢运行中的 Vault；HA、VPC endpoint、<code>disable_sealwrap</code> 与 DEK 缓存滞后共同决定真实故障窗口。</li>\n<li>密钥层级与 Barrier 加密见《<a href=\"../vault-storage-barrier/barrier-encryption-key-hierarchy\">Barrier 加密、根密钥层级与 Transit 加密即服务</a>》；无长期密钥的工作负载身份方案见《<a href=\"../secrets-architecture-zero-secret/zero-secret-workload-identity-federation\">零密钥工作负载与身份联合</a>》。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"KMS 集成、信封加密与外部密钥管理","id":"kms-集成-信封加密与外部密钥管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"信封加密的数据流与密钥层次","id":"信封加密的数据流与密钥层次"},{"level":2,"text":"Vault 与云 KMS 的三种集成形态","id":"vault-与云-kms-的三种集成形态"},{"level":2,"text":"轮换周期、密钥版本与 KMS 调用成本","id":"轮换周期-密钥版本与-kms-调用成本"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境数据驻留与多区域密钥拓扑","id":"跨境数据驻留与多区域密钥拓扑"},{"level":2,"text":"高可用：当 KMS 成为新的单点","id":"高可用-当-kms-成为新的单点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"轮换策略、滚动编排与依赖影响分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/secrets-management-vault-dynamic-secrets-encryption/rotation-kms-ha-ops/secret-rotation-policy-orchestration"},"next":{"title":"高可用、多区域容灾与事故运维实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/secrets-management-vault-dynamic-secrets-encryption/rotation-kms-ha-ops/ha-multiregion-dr-incident-ops"}}